cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "scania-aps-cost: Cost-Sensitive Machine Learning on Scania APS Failure Data"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible machine-learning study of air pressure system (APS) failure
  detection in Scania trucks, built on the UCI "APS Failure at Scania Trucks"
  dataset. The software compares regularization, optimization, imbalance
  handling, probability calibration, representation learning, feature selection
  and decision thresholds against an explicit maintenance cost function,
  J = 10 * FP + 500 * FN, rather than against accuracy. It implements a
  leakage-safe four-way development split (fit, tune, calibration, threshold)
  that keeps the official UCI test set outside every modelling decision.
type: software
